# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file.
#
# Accepted risk: every finding below comes from the @modelcontextprotocol/sdk
# HTTP transport layer (hono, @hono/node-server, path-to-regexp, fast-uri,
# body-parser, qs, ip-address). keyway-mcp runs exclusively over
# StdioServerTransport (see src/index.ts) — the SDK's HTTP/Streamable transport
# is never imported or executed, so this code path is unreachable at runtime.
